      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "If E15 is indeed related to a leak protection sensor, you'll need to check the sensor's integrity and dry out any moisture in the base of the machine. First, disconnect the drain hose and check the sensor for any signs of physical damage or blockages. Use a soft brush or cloth to gently clean the sensor area. To dry out the base, you can dry the area completely with a towel or let the dishwasher sit for a few hours with the door open to allow airflow.",
